  "content": "\n\n<h1>CoolAid's NoSignGUI</h1>\n<p><img src=\"https://img.shields.io/badge/Loaders-Fabric/Forge/NeoForge-red?style=for-the-badge\" alt=\"加载器 Fabric/Forge/NeoForge\">\n<img src=\"https://img.shields.io/badge/Versions-1.20_|_1.21_|_26.1_|_26.2-red?style=for-the-badge\" alt=\"版本 1.20 | 1.21 | 26.1 | 26.2\">\n<img src=\"https://img.shields.io/badge/Environments-Client-red?style=for-the-badge\" alt=\"运行环境 客户端\"></p>\n<h3>允许你开启或关闭告示牌的文本编辑界面！</h3>\n<ul>\n<li><strong>在使用大量空白告示牌进行建造或设置陷阱时，此功能尤为实用</strong></li>\n<li><strong>默认按 <code>G</code> 键即可切换该模组的开关</strong></li>\n<li><strong>灵感源自 <a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fmodrinth.com%252fmod%252fnosigngui\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Masonion 的 NoSignGUI</a> 模组</strong></li>\n<li><strong>支持悬挂式告示牌，且完全在客户端运行</strong></li>\n</ul>\n<h4>如有任何问题或功能建议，请在 <a href=\"https://github.com/CoolAid48/NoSignGUI/issues\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">GitHub</a> 上提交反馈</h4>\n<p><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fko-fi.com%252fcoolaid48\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img alt=\"在 Ko-fi 上支持我\" src=\"https://cdn.jsdelivr.net/npm/@intergrav/devins-badges@3.2.0/assets/cozy/donate/kofi-singular-alt_vector.svg\"></a>\n<a href=\"https://discord.gg/J2SGshKNah\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img alt=\"在 Discord 与我交流\" src=\"https://cdn.jsdelivr.net/npm/@intergrav/devins-badges@3.2.0/assets/cozy/social/discord-plural_vector.svg\"></a>\n<a href=\"https://www.twitch.tv/coolaid48\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img alt=\"在 Twitch 观看我的直播\" src=\"https://cdn.jsdelivr.net/npm/@intergrav/devins-badges@3.2.0/assets/cozy/social/twitch-singular_vector.svg\"></a></p>",
